# Source data stays out of version control: the CSV carries supplier, UPC,
# 9L case volumes, dollar sales and YoY movement. Only the derived
# app/data/bottles.js (name, size, tier, average retail price) ships.
*.csv

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Image working files: the drop folder is a staging area, and the API state
# is local progress. Published images in docs/img/ ARE tracked.
tools/incoming/
tools/image_state.json

# API keys stay out of git
tools/api_keys.json

# Cached Shopify catalogue pages: a scratch download, regenerated on demand
tools/shopify_cache/

# Python bytecode: a .pyc was tracked by accident and shows up as a change
# every time a tool runs
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated report. Rebuild it any time with:
#   python tools/coverage_report.py
Bottle Shot Coverage.xlsx

# Generated photo audit: contact sheets plus a ranked CSV. Rebuild with:
#   python tools/photo_audit.py
Photo Audit/
